      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- View Toggle -->
    <div class="view-controls">
      <button id="translation-view-btn" class="view-btn active">Translation View</button>
      <button id="scholarly-view-btn" class="view-btn">Scholarly View</button>
    </div>

    <div class="entry-content" data-pagefind-meta="excerpt:264. Deus nihil vult sine ratione [1678 bis 1681 (?)] [1678 bis 1681 (?)] Deus nihil vult sine ratione Probatur generaliter ex eo, quod nihil fit sine ratione. Nam nihil existit nisi omnia existant ad naturam ejus requisita. Omnium autem requisitorum existentiae simul sumtae sunt ratio rei. Ubi illu...">

